# medmate-server docs

- Requirement specs live in `requirements/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` and are written before implementation.
- Structural choices go in `decisions/` as the next numbered ADR. Do not hide them only in a requirement spec.
- `architecture.md` describes the current system. Update it when a module, datastore, or host changes.
- `cutover.md` stays the source for releasing `api.nammamedmate.com` from server-core.
